</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\texttt</span></span><span>{Sphere} and </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\texttt</span></span><span>{Pop} reinterpret abstraction and application geometrically; dependent types integrated with concurrency and probability </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\\</span></span><span>
