<h3 data-start="634" data-end="673">2. Force line breaks in long labels</h3>
<p data-start="674" data-end="747">You can wrap long arrows or objects with <code data-start="715" data-end="733">\shortstack{...}</code> or <code data-start="737" data-end="746">\parbox</code>:</p>
