<p data-start="6630" data-end="6902">If your venue is strict about proof detail, you can expand Lemma 6 by citing standard results: Fisher metric functoriality under sufficient statistics; compatibility of <code data-start="6799" data-end="6804">mix</code>/<code data-start="6805" data-end="6809">ev</code>/tensor with the exponential family structure (or your chosen model class) used in semantics.</p>
</li>
