nter gap-0.5"><span class=""><span class="flex items-center gap-1 truncate text-start align-middle text-token-text-secondary hover:text-token-text-primary" style="opacity: 1;">Thought for 6s</span></span></button></div></div></span><div class="max-w-[calc(0.8*var(--thread-content-max-width,40rem))]"></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="25065052-ea70-4fdf-85e6-a64beb118034" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-thinking"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="423">awesome—here’s clean, language-agnostic pseudocode for a full pipeline that (1) builds time-varying interbrain graphs from hyperscanning, (2) computes discrete curvatures (Forman–Ricci and optional Ollivier–Ricci), (3) estimates entropy of curvature distributions, and (4) flags phase transitions. I also included optional hooks to map the results into your RSVP/adequacy vocabulary (negentropic corridors, rupture/repair).</p>
