</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\paragraph</span></span><span>{Entropy of curvature distribution.}
Given edgewise curvatures </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\{</span></span><span>F(e)</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\}</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> in window </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>s</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>, estimate differential entropy
