<hr data-start="3863" data-end="3866">
<h2 data-start="3868" data-end="3885">6. Conclusions</h2>
<p data-start="3886" data-end="4175">Academic satire is maximized by rigorously respecting the syntax of mathematics while systematically violating its semantics. The extrapolated curvature of semantic manifolds serves as a canonical example: entirely correct, entirely useless, and therefore a perfect vehicle for critique.</p>
