<h3 data-start="2917" data-end="2937">Interpretation</h3>
<ul data-start="2939" data-end="3145">
<li data-start="2939" data-end="3002">
<p data-start="2941" data-end="3002"><strong data-start="2941" data-end="2947">ΔS</strong> = surprise from redistributed weights (incongruity).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3003" data-end="3059">
<p data-start="3005" data-end="3059"><strong data-start="3005" data-end="3011">ΔK</strong> = geometric distortion of the semantic space.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3060" data-end="3145">
<p data-start="3062" data-end="3145"><strong data-start="3062" data-end="3085">Intensity = ΔS × ΔK</strong> = the “laugh amplitude” (resolution through frame shift).</p>
</li>
</ul>
