e’s a compact, fully worked vignette you can drop into the paper. It formalizes <strong data-start="93" data-end="115">separation anxiety</strong> as a curvature–entropy spike on the child’s semantic/emotional manifold, then shows how <strong data-start="204" data-end="230">learning (inoculation)</strong> and <strong data-start="235" data-end="262">play (simulated danger)</strong> jointly flatten that spike and widen the negentropic corridor.</p>
<hr data-start="327" data-end="330">
<h2 data-start="332" data-end="428">Worked Example: Separation Anxiety as Curvature Spike and Its Reduction via Learning and Play</h2>
<h3 data-start="430" data-end="468">Setup: State space, fields, priors</h3>
<p data-start="469" data-end="814">Let the child’s contextual manifold be <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="script">S</mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant="script">C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">X=\mathcal{S}\times\mathcal{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.07847em;">X</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.7667em; vertical-align: -0.0833em;"></span><span class="mord mathcal" style="margin-right: 0.075em;">S</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">×</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathcal" style="margin-right: 0.05834em;">C</span></span></span></span>, where <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="script">S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{S}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathcal" style="margin-right: 0.075em;">S</span></span></span></span> are self-states and <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="script">C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathcal" style="margin-right: 0.05834em;">C</span></span></span></span> are caregiver contexts. Consider the caregiver-present/absent axis <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator="true">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c\in\{0,1\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.5782em; vertical-align: -0.0391em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">c</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">∈</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">{</span><span class="mord">0</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mclose">}</span></span></span></span>, embedded as a geodesic coordinate on <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.07847em;">X</span></span></span></span>. The RSVP fields are <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo separator="true">,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="bold">v</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo separator="true">,</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\Phi_t,\mathbf{v}_t,S_t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">Φ</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2806em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">t</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathbf" style="margin-right: 0.01597em;">v</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2806em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.016em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">t</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">S</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2806em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0576em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">t</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span> with informational metric <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">g_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.625em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">g</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2806em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0359em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">t</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
<ul data-start="816" data-end="1209">
<li data-start="816" data-end="934">
<p data-start="818" data-end="871">Baseline prior: high certainty on caregiver presence,</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator="true">,</mo><mspace width="1em"></mspace><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mu_0(c{=}1)\approx 1,\quad \mu_0(c{=}0)\approx 0.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">μ</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">0</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">c</span><span class="mord"><span class="mrel">=</span></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">≈</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 1em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">μ</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">0</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">c</span><span class="mord"><span class="mrel">=</span></span><span class="mord">0</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">≈</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">0.</span></span></span></span></span>
</li>
<li data-start="935" data-end="1010">
<p data-start="937" data-end="1010">Surprise at separation (trial <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6151em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span></span></span></span>): <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="script">S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{S}_t=-\log p_t(c{=}0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathcal" style="margin-right: 0.075em;">S</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2806em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.075em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">t</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord">−</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mop">lo<span style="margin-right: 0.01389em;">g</span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">p</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2806em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">t</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">c</span><span class="mord"><span class="mrel">=</span></span><span class="mord">0</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1011" data-end="1136">
<p data-start="1013" data-end="1070">Local curvature on the “separation ridge” <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>⊂</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">U\subset X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.7224em; vertical-align: -0.0391em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.10903em;">U</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">⊂</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.07847em;">X</span></span></span></span>:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>κ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>:</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∥</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">R</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">c</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">∣</mi><mi>U</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">∥</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">p</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\kappa_t := \|\mathrm{Ric}(g_t)|_{U}\|_{\mathrm{op}}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.5806em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">κ</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2806em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">t</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1.0361em; vertical-align: -0.2861em;"></span><span class="mord">∥</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">Ric</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">g</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2806em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0359em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">t</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">∣</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.10903em;">U</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">∥</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.1514em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathrm mtight">op</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2861em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord">.</span></span></span></span></span>
</li>
<li data-start="1137" data-end="1209">
<p data-start="1139" data-end="1209">Corridor width (robustness at the ridge): <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w_t&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6891em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02691em;">w</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2806em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0269em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">t</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">&gt;</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">0</span></span></span></span> (larger is safer).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start="1211" data-end="1251">Dynamics: Curvature–entropy coupling</h3>
<p data-start="1252" data-end="1382">We use a minimal discrete-time coupling that captures the spike at separation and the stabilizing feedback of learned inoculation:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mtable rowspacing="0.25em" columnalign="right left" columnspacing="0em"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mtext> </mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo fence="false" stretchy="true" minsize="1.2em" maxsize="1.2em">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="script">S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="script">S</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo fence="false" stretchy="true" minsize="1.2em" maxsize="1.2em">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>shock</mtext></munder><mtext>  </mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>  </mtext><munder><munder><mrow><mi>β</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>buffer</mtext></munder><mo separator="true">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><msub><mi>κ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mtext> </mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>κ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo fence="false" stretchy="true" minsize="1.2em" maxsize="1.2em">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="script">S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="script">S</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo fence="false" stretchy="true" minsize="1.2em" maxsize="1.2em">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>tightening</mtext></munder><mtext>  </mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>  </mtext><munder><munder><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>softening</mtext></munder><mo separator="true">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mtext> </mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mrow><mi>η</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>capacity&nbsp;gain</mtext></munder><mtext>  </mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>  </mtext><munder><munder><mrow><mi>ζ</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>κ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>pinching</mtext></munder><mo separator="true">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mtext> </mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant="double-struck">E</mi><mo fence="false" stretchy="true" minsize="1.2em" maxsize="1.2em">[</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" stretchy="true" minsize="1.2em" maxsize="1.2em">]</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>learning&nbsp;inoculation</mtext></munder><mtext>  </mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>  </mtext><munder><munder><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mn mathvariant="bold">1</mn><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>overload</mtext></munder><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{aligned}
S_{t+1} &amp;\,=\, S_t + \underbrace{\alpha\big(\mathcal{S}_t-\bar{\mathcal{S}}\big)}_{\text{shock}} \;-\; \underbrace{\beta\, w_t}_{\text{buffer}},\\
\kappa_{t+1} &amp;\,=\, \kappa_t + \underbrace{\gamma\big(\mathcal{S}_t-\bar{\mathcal{S}}\big)}_{\text{tightening}} \;-\; \underbrace{\delta\, w_t}_{\text{softening}},\\
w_{t+1} &amp;\,=\, w_t + \underbrace{\eta\,\Phi_t}_{\text{capacity gain}} \;-\; \underbrace{\zeta\, \kappa_t}_{\text{pinching}},\\
