</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\item</span></span><span> Learning is inoculation: priors absorb structured variability, increasing </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Phi</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> and widening </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>w</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>.  
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\item</span></span><span> Play is simulated danger: bounded perturbations accelerate corridor widening without overload.  
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\item</span></span><span> Safety is formalized: </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\sigma</span></span><span>(</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Delta</span></span><span> c) &lt; </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\sigma</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>c</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> prevents entropic blowouts; stability follows from </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\beta</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\delta</span></span><span> &gt; </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\alpha</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\gamma</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> and sufficient </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\eta</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\lambda</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>.  
