empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="263">You can add a forward-looking gesture to the introduction/abstract that lightly references humor, complex emotions, hyperscanning, and the ontogenetic parade without overwhelming the abstract. Here’s a revised version of your abstract with just enough of a nod:</p>
