<p data-start="862" data-end="970">→ In your tables and text, you’ve used commands like <code data-start="915" data-end="924">\mathbf</code>, <code data-start="926" data-end="936">\mathcal</code>, or math symbols outside <code data-start="962" data-end="969">$...$</code>.</p>
