<li data-start="1588" data-end="1637">
<p data-start="1590" data-end="1637">formalize with interference of $M_1$ and $M_2$.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1639" data-end="1642">
<h3 data-start="1644" data-end="1667">5. <strong data-start="1651" data-end="1667">RSVP Mapping</strong></h3>
<ul data-start="1668" data-end="1939">
<li data-start="1668" data-end="1714">
<p data-start="1670" data-end="1714">At present maps connector entropy to fields.</p>
