</li>
<li data-start="1849" data-end="1939">
<p data-start="1851" data-end="1939">Tie in the category + sheaf formalism (already drafted) to unify emotion-as-inoculation.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1941" data-end="1944">
<h3 data-start="1946" data-end="1969">6. <strong data-start="1953" data-end="1969">Applications</strong></h3>
