</li>
<li data-start="2725" data-end="2766">
<p data-start="2727" data-end="2766">applications to therapy and psychiatry.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="2767" data-end="2916">
<p data-start="2769" data-end="2916">End with the “final note” style we drafted — emphasizing that the framework operationalizes second-person active inference but also reveals limits.</p>
