empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="320">Got it — thanks for sharing the LaTeX file. Right now, your draft is already coherent, but some of the things we <em data-start="113" data-end="132">discussed earlier</em> (humor, complex emotions, the ontogenetic parade, and hyperscanning) are scattered into mid-sections without being reflected back in the framing paragraphs (intro, outline, conclusion).</p>
<p data-start="322" data-end="402">To <strong data-start="325" data-end="369">expand and reintegrate what was left out</strong>, here are the steps I’d suggest:</p>
<hr data-start="404" data-end="407">
<h3 data-start="409" data-end="424">1. Abstract</h3>
<p data-start="425" data-end="691">You already mention humor, complex emotions, hyperscanning, and the ontogenetic parade here — good.<br data-start="524" data-end="527">
To expand: add one or two bridging sentences near the end that emphasize these are not “side notes” but <em data-start="631" data-end="652">core demonstrations</em> of the framework’s reach. For example:</p>
<blockquote data-start="692" data-end="856">
<p data-start="694" data-end="856">“These extensions show how a unified curvature–entropy approach spans computational models, affective dynamics, developmental trajectories, and social synchrony.”</p>
</blockquote>
<hr data-start="858" data-end="861">
<h3 data-start="863" data-end="882">2. Introduction</h3>
<p data-start="883" data-end="959">Right after you list the domains (AI, therapy, neuroscience), you could add:</p>
<ul data-start="960" data-end="1280">
<li data-start="960" data-end="1042">
<p data-start="962" data-end="1042">A sentence about <em data-start="979" data-end="986">humor</em> as a test case of “manifold interference” resolution.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1043" data-end="1112">
<p data-start="1045" data-end="1112">A sentence about <em data-start="1062" data-end="1080">complex emotions</em> as higher-order inoculations.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1113" data-end="1187">
<p data-start="1115" data-end="1187">A sentence about <em data-start="1132" data-end="1152">ontogenetic parade</em> as developmental curvature flow.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1188" data-end="1280">
<p data-start="1190" data-end="1280">Tie these into <em data-start="1205" data-end="1220">hyperscanning</em> by suggesting they are <em data-start="1244" data-end="1279">empirically measurable signatures</em>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1282" data-end="1365">So the intro signals these later extensions, instead of them arriving as surprises.</p>
<hr data-start="1367" data-end="1370">
<h3 data-start="1372" data-end="1397">3. Contributions list</h3>
<p data-start="1398" data-end="1496">Right now you have 5 points. I’d suggest splitting or rephrasing so each special theme is visible:</p>
<ul data-start="1497" data-end="1801">
<li data-start="1497" data-end="1544">
<p data-start="1499" data-end="1544">Keep curvature definition and RSVP mapping.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1545" data-end="1608">
<p data-start="1547" data-end="1608">Add explicit bullet for <em data-start="1571" data-end="1605">humor + complex emotion taxonomy</em>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1609" data-end="1687">
<p data-start="1611" data-end="1687">Add explicit bullet for <em data-start="1635" data-end="1684">ontogenetic parade + developmental trajectories</em>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1688" data-end="1801">
<p data-start="1690" data-end="1801">Keep therapy + hyperscanning.<br data-start="1719" data-end="1722">
This makes each of those strands visible to readers scanning the contributions.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1803" data-end="1806">
<h3 data-start="1808" data-end="1877">4. Structure paragraph (“The monograph is structured as follows”)</h3>
<p data-start="1878" data-end="2056">You can reintegrate by smoothing:<br data-start="1911" data-end="1914">
Instead of just “Part III extends the framework to humor, complex emotions, and the ontogenetic parade,” write a fuller sentence linking them:</p>
<blockquote data-start="2057" data-end="2268">
<p data-start="2059" data-end="2268">“Part III develops affective and developmental extensions: humor as frame-shift manifold interference, complex emotions as recursive inoculations, and the ontogenetic parade as age-structured curvature flows.”</p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start="2270" data-end="2301">That way they’re clearly named.</p>
<hr data-start="2303" data-end="2306">
<h3 data-start="2308" data-end="2326">5. Conclusions</h3>
<p data-start="2327" data-end="2434">You already added a note about humor, emotions, and the parade. Expand by adding one “final note” sentence:</p>
<blockquote data-start="2435" data-end="2637">
<p data-start="2437" data-end="2637">“Taken together, humor, complex affect, hyperscanning, and the ontogenetic parade demonstrate how curvature–entropy methods connect micro-level cognition, dyadic regulation, and lifespan development.”</p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start="2639" data-end="2671">That makes the thematic closure.</p>
<hr data-start="2673" data-end="2676">
<h3 data-start="2678" data-end="2697">6. Related Work</h3>
<p data-start="2698" data-end="2753">You don’t need to add citations, but you could mention:</p>
<ul data-start="2754" data-end="2969">
<li data-start="2754" data-end="2824">
<p data-start="2756" data-end="2824">Incongruity theories of humor (without citation, just as context).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2825" data-end="2969">
<p data-start="2827" data-end="2969">Developmental psychology baseline (ontogenetic parade) as aligning with manifold curvature.<br data-start="2918" data-end="2921">
This way your related work anchors those pieces.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="2971" data-end="2974">
<p data-start="2976" data-end="3259" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Would you like me to <strong data-start="2997" data-end="3071">rewrite your Introduction and Contributions sections directly in LaTeX</strong> with these expansions, so they align seamlessly with what’s already in your monograph? That way the humor/emotion/parade/hyperscanning strands are fully reintegrated from start to finish.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.